格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Electron 37 on HarmonyOS / OpenHarmony — run DeepSeek Harness (DSH) as a native 2in1 / tablet app. 鸿蒙上的 AI Agent 工作台","id":"gh:1349099033","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-desktop-hos","slug":"fellow99/dsh-desktop-hos","topics":["2in1","arkts","deepseek-harness","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-market","dsh-plugin","electron","harmonyos","harmonyos-next","openharmony"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Electron 37 on HarmonyOS / OpenHarmony — run DeepSeek Harness (DSH) as a native 2in1 / tablet app. 鸿"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"armonyOS / OpenHarmony — run DeepSeek Harness (DSH) as a native 2in1 / tablet app. 鸿蒙上的 AI Agent 工作台"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# DSH Desktop · Electron on HarmonyOS Edition"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Electron on HarmonyOS Edition** — the official DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web UI, **unmodified**, ru"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"nning on HarmonyOS 2in1 / tablet through Electron 37: a real Electron app on HarmonyOS, not an ArkUI"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" rewrite of the interface. The other HarmonyOS edition, HarmonyOS Edition, drops Electron entirely —"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" system ArkWeb plus an in-process Node runtime."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Device capture, not a mockup — HarmonyOS 6.1.0.135 (API 24), 2in1. The UI is the official dsh Web UI"},{"id":"p5s2","text":", loaded same-origin from the in-process dsh Host."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Status** `0.2.2` (`versionCode` 1100) — built and signed. Core flows (chat, agent loop, tool calls"},{"id":"p6s2","text":", session persistence, plugin market, window state) were verified on a HarmonyOS 6.1.0.135 (API 24) "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"device for **0.2.0**; the **0.2.2** build has not been re-verified on device yet (build + signature "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"verified only). Distribution reality up front: a **debug-signed HAP is bound to the signing account/"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"device**, and a **release-signed package can only ship through AppGallery** — see How to get it."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why this port is different"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"There are other ways to get DSH onto HarmonyOS. The trade-off is the whole story of this repo:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| | This project (Electron route) | A native-host route (Node runtime + ArkUI host) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Interface | The **official Web UI, byte-for-byte** — nothing re-implemented | A native host around"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the same Web content; platform chrome is rewritten |\n| Fidelity to desktop | Identical semantics: s"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ame renderer, same Node APIs, same data plane | Good, but the host layer is a re-implementation that"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" must track upstream |\n| Runtime permission | Requires the ACL restricted permission `ohos.permissio"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"n.kernel.ALLOW_WRITABLE_CODE_MEMORY` (JIT) — **2in1 / tablet only** | No JIT, so no such permission "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"|\n| Device reach | HarmonyOS 2in1 / tablet | Can extend to phones |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Neither is \"better\"; they optimize different things. This repo exists to prove the Electron route en"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d-to-end — including every sandbox conflict it hits. The other editions share the same shell archite"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"cture and data plane: dsh-desktop for Windows / Linux / macOS, and dsh-desktop-ark for the **Harmony"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"OS Edition** (system ArkWeb + an in-process Node runtime, no Electron)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## What works today"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Capability | State |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| dsh Web UI in a window (100% reuse of the dsh frontend) | ✅ |\n| Session persistence + full-text se"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"arch (`better-sqlite3`, aarch64 ABI 138) | ✅ |\n| Plugin marketplace (`dshmarket` built in) | ✅ |\n| W"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"indow state persistence (maximized / bounds) + F11 fullscreen | ✅ |\n| Command execution — non-PTY re"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"sident `/system/bin/sh` driven by a sentinel-line protocol, with a tool-layer path fence | ✅ ⚠️ the "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"fence is **best-effort and bypassable, not a sandbox** |\n| Image attachments — `sharp` replaced by a"},{"id":"p14s6","text":" pure-JS container parser; conversions it cannot do are routed through the platform image framework "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"by an ArkTS bridge (decode / EXIF / scale / re-encode) | ⚠️ clean 8-bit sRGB files pass through byte"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"-identically; with no bridge reachable every conversion is refused with an explicit error; no thumbn"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ails |\n| Bundling our own Node / Python runtime (ELF) | ⛔ **not possible** — shipping an ELF require"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"s a binary certificate (AGC `certType: 4`), which Huawei does not grant to individual developers |\n|"},{"id":"p14s11","text":" Bundling the pure-JS **pnpm** engine (plugin market) | ✅ pnpm 10.34.6 runs in-process (`dsh-market-"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"pnpm` in a worker via `harmony-plugin-market-runtime`) — no ELF, no terminal install; market install"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"/uninstall verified on device |\n| Process sandbox (`koffi` / landlock) | ❌ out of scope |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Limits, in detail"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Command execution.** Upstream's `tool-bash` row stays disabled: `node-pty` has no aarch64 artifa"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ct, and PTY is denied by SELinux. The replacement spawns a resident `/system/bin/sh` and reads repli"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"es through a sentinel line; the path fence lives in the tool layer and is **bypassable by design**.\n"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"- **Bundled runtime.** Shipping our own Node or Python **ELF binary** remains impossible (binary cer"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"tificate). What *is* shipped today is the pure-JavaScript **pnpm 10.34.6** engine, materialized into"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" `dsh-dist/node_modules/dsh-market-pnpm` and executed inside a worker thread by `harmony-plugin-mark"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"et-runtime` (`DSH_PNPM_ENGINE`); plugin-market install/uninstall therefore needs no system-terminal "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"step (device-verified). Nothing else depends on a bundled runtime: command execution spawns the syst"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"em's own `sh`/`toybox`, and the file / search / skill / subagent / image features are pure JS. (Hist"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"orical analysis of the ELF restriction: `docs/鸿蒙环境能力清单-v0.1.5.md` §C.8.)\n- **Images.** The stub pars"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"es PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP container headers; anything it cannot convert is handed to the ArkTS bridge (de"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"code, EXIF orientation, scale, re-encode to JPEG/WebP/PNG). Clean 8-bit sRGB input inside the limits"},{"id":"p16s13","text":" passes through byte-identically at zero conversion cost. With no bridge reachable (plain Node), eve"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"ry conversion is refused with an explicit, attributed error. No thumbnails."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Shell | dsh (upstream tag) | Runtime | Device / API | Verified |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `0.2.2` · `versionCode` 1100 | `dsh-v0.2.2-rc.1` | Electron 37 / Node 22.17.0 (`harmonypc-electron"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"`) | HarmonyOS 6.1.0.135 · API 24 · 2in1 / tablet | built & signed; on-device re-verification pendin"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"g (0.2.0 was verified) |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`versionCode` must be a number and must **strictly increase** on every AppGallery submission. Upstre"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"am dsh is a developer preview: each shell pins one tag, and `patches/<dsh-tag>/` moves with it."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"One process, one origin on the device: the Electron main process **hosts the dsh Host** (webserver +"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" API + WebSocket) and the window loads the standard dsh Web UI from it — no CORS, no auth, no custom"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" protocol, no IPC carrier."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Three HarmonyOS adaptations make it work: **loopback isolation** (bind a wildcard address, then rewr"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ite `Host`/`Origin` back to loopback inside the session), **no symlinks or hardlinks** (copy for pro"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"file publishing, same-directory `rename` for atomic writes), and **`HOME` redirection** into the san"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"dbox. Because the listener is wildcard, treat this as a single-user local app and keep it off untrus"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ted networks. The patch list, threat notes and the full rationale live in the maintainer guide."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

