ne, materialized into"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" `dsh-dist/node_modules/dsh-market-pnpm` and executed inside a worker thread by `harmony-plugin-mark"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"et-runtime` (`DSH_PNPM_ENGINE`); plugin-market install/uninstall therefore needs no system-terminal "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"step (device-verified). Nothing else depends on a bundled runtime: command execution spawns the syst"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"em's own `sh`/`toybox`, and the file / search / skill / subagent / image features are pure JS. (Hist"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"orical analysis of the ELF restriction: `docs/鸿蒙环境能力清单-v0.1.5.md` §C.8.)\n- **Images.** The stub pars"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"es PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP container headers; anything it cannot convert is handed to the ArkTS bridge (de"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"code, EXIF orientation, scale, re-encode to JPEG/WebP/PNG). Clean 8-bit sRGB input inside the limits"},{"id":"p16s13","text":" passes through byte-identically at zero conversion cost. With no bridge reachable (plain Node), eve"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"ry conversion is refused with an explicit, attributed error. No thumbnails."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Shell | dsh (upstream tag) | Runtime | Device / API | Verified |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `0.2.2` · `versionCode` 1100 | `dsh-v0.2.2-rc.1` | Electron 37 / Node 22.17.0 (`harmonypc-electron"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"`) | HarmonyOS 6.1.0.135 · API 24 · 2in1 / tablet | built & signed; on-device re-verification pendin"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"g (0.2.0 was verified) |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`versionCode` must be a number and must **strictly increase** on every AppGallery submission. Upstre"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"am dsh is a developer preview: each shell pins one tag, and `patches/<dsh-tag>/` moves with it."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"One process, one origin on the device: the Electron main process **hosts the dsh Host** (webserver +"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" API + WebSocket) and the window loads the standard dsh Web UI from it — no CORS, no auth, no custom"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" protocol, no IPC carrier."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Three HarmonyOS adaptations make it work: **loopback isolation** (bind a wildcard address, then rewr"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ite `Host`/`Origin` back to loopback inside the session), **no symlinks or hardlinks** (copy for pro"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"file publishing, same-directory `rename` for atomic writes), and **`HOME` redirection** into the san"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"dbox. Because the listener is wildcard, treat this as a single-user local app and keep it off untrus"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ted networks. The patch list, threat notes and the full rationale live in the maintainer guide."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["output_not_object","output_not_object","finish_reason"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
